From 9b58fe6ec4a56116fe64f2f13660dad4a6181eb2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnSnow <110465696+JohnSnow14284@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Jul 2026 15:36:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/23] Per-player Create train distance & LOD fixes

Add per-player client->server sync for Create distant-train render distance: new TrainRenderRequestPayload, DistantTrainClientSync, and payload handler in Voxy. Server stores client preferences in DistantTrainConfig (per-player map) and CreateTrainSampler now computes a per-player stream window, optionally clamped by a server-wide ceiling (CreateServerConfig). Add safe integrated-server request cap and new VoxyConfig constants/bounds; update config UI ranges and trigger client sync on save/login. Fix LOD ownership stencil gating in distant renderers (use EQUAL ownership test) to avoid depth-reprojection holes.
